      "root_causes": [
        "The result_ref, open_input_ref, capture record and receipt can be rebound as one internally consistent tuple because no independent search-response or open-action envelope owns their provenance.",
        "The capture outcome algebra omits the stated identity-ambiguity state, and the pinned URL callable accepts explicit-empty port and empty query or fragment delimiters that the simple-identity prose assumes are already closed.",
        "The content-evidence hash has no exact recomputable artifact and the locator receipt does not bind semantic disposition, contamination, four-dimensional job assignment, author independence, early stop or derived count."
      ],
      "upstream_remediation_boundary": [
        "Downgrade opaque result refs to within-run correlation unless an execution adapter can persist authoritative search-response and open-action envelopes; do not invent stable provenance.",
        "Define one closed capture outcome sum type and either reuse a separately reviewed raw-serialization identity component or conservatively use exact Gate-accepted raw final-locator bytes and hashes without new normalization.",
        "Bind an exact recomputable content artifact and a separately reviewable semantic-decision record to eligibility, stop and count; otherwise use a fixed window that does not depend on unaudited online semantics."
      ],
      "protocol_authority_ceiling_if_future_passes": "PROTOCOL_ACCEPTED_FOR_IMPLEMENTATION_ONLY"
